{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（3日）中午11時56分，警方接報荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓對開有樹枝由高處墮下，擊中一名女長者的頭部。女傷者半清醒，由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院治理。</p><p>現場是石圍角路往荃灣方向的行人路，大樹生在石圍角邨石荷樓對開，其中約6米長、5厘米直徑的樹椏斷裂，跌落約20米下的行人路，該處在巴士站不遠處。消防員到場鋸斷其餘有危險的部份，並圍封現場，案件暫列有人暈倒處理。</p><figure><img alt=\"荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓有樹枝由高處墮下，跌落約20米下的石圍角路打中一名女長者頭部。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194271709872787456983057.jpeg/ICvL0EA3I6aGuOv3kewUNqnv9YNUfPqp4snRRMfJ0UQ\"/><figcaption>荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓有樹枝由高處墮下，跌落約20米下的石圍角路打中一名女長者頭部。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺有血迹。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194271707167330304791586.jpeg/-T3euO4FuSRMH2Hy-Ps5XQ7XaqPi4H9HCLpeyi26Xso\"/><figcaption>現場遺有血迹。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員將樹放在一旁。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194271704654811136590263.jpeg/BgLpp90sPMz5hHcjb7BImaVsEKLFVquisb0kSZS9JEk\"/><figcaption>消防員將樹放在一旁。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"其中一條樹椏斷裂丟下。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194277297188769792652890.jpeg/CUJDAXOyMeDKeHFkC4z0lQbpTn4BlJabZflKxWX5SsU\"/><figcaption>其中一條樹椏斷裂丟下。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場清理危險的樹枝。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194277300514983936172450.jpeg/gU-882rdqbcJuRhEYD_CqcqujWgHN2daLXlIpy15SKc\"/><figcaption>消防員在場清理危險的樹枝。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場清理危險的樹枝。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194277303463710720469518.jpeg/ClqlvrfuEh0qq9av_XjE1mdABbqyaDdXz8SzH8_Esx8\"/><figcaption>消防員在場清理危險的樹枝。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瑪嘉烈醫院（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194266435094843392507469.jpeg/DDBQVVN6TdvhXElzw4H7CEKWCcAnhloxyk49AMpOPQA\"/><figcaption>瑪嘉烈醫院（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:22:37.478159+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:36:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:22.863656+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:22.863656+00:00","content_hash":"b45874cc2bc9e3df1ee650ab18d9d7ab74f574864c28304ae43de0a5b9c09ab0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}